  "reductionTo": {
    "problemName": "Exact Cover",
    "formalDefinition": "Exact Cover = {\u003CS, X\u003E | S is a collection of subsets of a set X where S* exists such that S* is a subcollection of S and an exact cover, of S. This means that each element of X is in exactly one subset of S*.} ",
    "problemDefinition": "The exact cover problem is a decision problem to determine if an exact cover exists for some \u003CS, X\u003E",
    "inputDescription": "X, a set, and S, a collection of subsets of X",
    "outputDescription": "True or False, whether an exact cover of X exists using subsets from S",
